# armour/shared/pauldron_fur6_r: the legend FUR pauldron on the right shoulder (fur.6; ARMOUR-X, wave 2: PLAN "The envelope in production", STYLE_P2 29).
# a fur mantle over the shoulder and the collar: 2-4 px tufts with lit tips, a soft ragged foot (MANTLE; the
# legend size the great one grown a tuft out and a row down; the medium size a short collar of tufts).
